EDICT 0006: a capture point at the start of Host_ServerFrame

Category: harness hook, no change in results.
One capture point where the server frame begins (the non-FPS_20 Host_ServerFrame, the one compiled): with
-edictcapture, EdictCapture_ServerFrame (ref/src/edict_capture.c) writes the frame number, host_frametime, the
rand seed, sv.time and what changed since the last record. In a frame that spawns a map (the first, and every
restart) SV_SpawnServer runs SV_Physics twice before the frame's own server part; this record is what tells the
replay where the latter begins (docs/PLAN.md section C, cut 3, step 2). The capture code only reads. Checked when
added: the per-frame hashes of all 10 R9 maps are identical with and without the patch.

